1) one seed, one run: the daily is the same ten kicks for everyone
   run 20260904 is stable, differs from the next day, and a replay of seed 777 scores 663 twice
2) skill beats spam: aiming is worth more than any one fixed input
   skilled: 1125 points, 4.1 of 10 scored
   always down the middle, full power: 179 points, 0.9 scored
   always top left, full power: 648 points, 2.3 scored
   always bottom right, full power: 178 points, 0.7 scored
   always the same soft chip: 183 points, 0.8 scored
   random every time: 547 points, 2.0 scored
