3) the run gets harder: the last three kicks are meaner than the first three
   first three scored 66% of the time, last three 13%
4) every kick is winnable and none of them is free
   10 kicks swept over 450 aims each: 0 unwinnable, 0 free
5) the wall and the keeper both matter
   low into the wall: Into the wall.; the same spot raised: Keeper got there.
   a 0.2 keeper saves 12% of what reaches him, a 0.8 keeper 100%

simFreeKick: green. The corners pay, one button does not, and the keeper is real.
